* B1: 8x8 row-scanned LED matrix (common-column cathode via 150 ohm), 8 non-overlapping row slots of 124 us in a 1 ms frame
.include models.inc
VROW0 row0 0 PULSE(0 5 0u 1n 1n 124u 1m)
VROW1 row1 0 PULSE(0 5 125u 1n 1n 124u 1m)
VROW2 row2 0 PULSE(0 5 250u 1n 1n 124u 1m)
VROW3 row3 0 PULSE(0 5 375u 1n 1n 124u 1m)
